# KPSS Job Aggregation Platform

## Project Overview
An autonomous system to aggregate and display KPSS job listings from various sources.

## Architecture
- Frontend: Next.js (TypeScript + Tailwind CSS)
- Database: Supabase/PostgreSQL
- Scrapers: Modular scripts (Node.js/Cheerio or Playwright)

## Directory Structure
- `/scrapers`: Web scraping logic
- `/lib/supabase`: Supabase configuration and clients
- `/components`: UI components
- `/types`: TypeScript interfaces
- `/pages`: Next.js pages

